    "body": "Thank you for your response @andytom.\r\n![Screen Shot 2021-08-12 at 4 11 30 PM](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/25261413/129281457-f75fc6a9-7a61-4b4e-bb3c-445d9a42976c.png)\r\n That ends up removing the newline at the start of every prompt but now the output of the last prompt and the next prompt squish together, decreasing readability. Is there a way I could potentially add a newline at the end of every output or perhaps add a blank line before every prompt without the triangle?",
